```python
def chains(rel, n=4):
    """All finite non-decreasing (causal) sequences under the relation."""
    for seq in itertools.product(range(n), repeat=n):
        if all((seq[i], seq[i+1]) in rel for i in range(n-1)):
            yield seq
```
Note: sequences need not be strictly increasing and can have repeats; with reflexivity repeats are allowed.

